# 📊 Mermaid Diagrams

### Comprehension Building Block

```mermaid
graph LR

A[Iterable] --> B[for item in iterable]
B --> C{Condition?}
C -->|True| D[Apply Expression]
C -->|False| E[Skip Item]
D --> F[New Collection]
```

### Iterator vs Generator Flow

```mermaid
graph TD

A[for loop starts]
A --> B[Calls iter on object]
B --> C[Gets an Iterator]
C --> D[Calls next repeatedly]
D --> E{More items?}
E -->|Yes| F[Return next value]
F --> D
E -->|No| G[StopIteration - loop ends]
```

