# 📌 Cheat Sheet

| Concept | Syntax |
|----------|--------|
| List comprehension | `[expr for x in iterable if cond]` |
| Dict comprehension | `{k: v for x in iterable}` |
| Set comprehension | `{expr for x in iterable}` |
| Unpacking | `a, b = (1, 2)` |
| Packing rest | `first, *rest = [1,2,3]` |
| Unpack into args | `func(*my_list)` |
